{"repositoryId":1075144509,"availability":"available","full":"alchemist4real/MR-CAPSULES","name":"MR-CAPSULES","description":"A learning platform initiated in August 2025, evolving from simple HTML files shared among friends to a web-based iframe platform. What began as a collection of previous years' study materials has grown into a comprehensive resource featuring lecture notes, question banks, and faculty presentation slides.","category":"Education","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-10-13T05:20:34Z","updated":"2026-10-12T06:34:53Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://mr-capsules.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://mr-capsules.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.134Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.134Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.134Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.134Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["MR-CAPSULES is a non-profit open-source educational sanctuary established in August 2025, dedicated to preserving, sharing, and transforming academic materials for medical and health science students.","What started as shared HTML notes among friends has evolved into an advanced, web-based educational ecosystem. The platform converts dense lecture slides, past exam questions, and practicum manuals into centralized, interactive Choice-Based Test (CBT) question pools, OSCE practice modules, and Live Study Rooms.","Beyond serving as a static archive, MR-CAPSULES functions as a hybrid platform equipped with an Admin Management Portal, an integrated Kanban workflow, and a full Model Context Protocol (MCP) serverless API gateway for seamless AI assistant collaboration."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alchemist4real/MR-CAPSULES/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b451166ca908bc8dbf33e694679a384786092f8993661dba832418c1606b01bd","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.293Z"},"overviewCheck